1
00:01:08,530 --> 00:01:12,990
[Faces Reborn]

2
00:01:13,080 --> 00:01:16,030
[Episode 21]

3
00:01:18,640 --> 00:01:20,000
These public opinions and media reports

4
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:21,950
generally cannot be admitted

5
00:01:22,120 --> 00:01:23,400
as direct evidence in court.

6
00:01:23,400 --> 00:01:25,510
But they'll be enough
to destroy his reputation.

7
00:01:25,510 --> 00:01:26,440
Attorney Zhang,

8
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:28,020
my ultimate goal

9
00:01:28,640 --> 00:01:31,080
is to see Zhao Xiao brought to justice.

10
00:01:31,310 --> 00:01:33,710
If we can obtain a recording of Zhao Xiao
incriminating himself

11
00:01:33,710 --> 00:01:35,170
and use it as key evidence,

12
00:01:35,200 --> 00:01:36,789
we can use the timeline

13
00:01:36,789 --> 00:01:38,310
of the suicide case reported in the media

14
00:01:38,310 --> 00:01:39,150
to request

15
00:01:39,150 --> 00:01:41,229
Zhao Xiao's travel records from that time
from the court

16
00:01:41,229 --> 00:01:43,640
and establish
a complete chain of evidence.

17
00:01:43,640 --> 00:01:44,750
A recording...

18
00:01:44,780 --> 00:01:45,759
It won't be easy

19
00:01:45,759 --> 00:01:48,060
to get your recording admitted
as legal evidence.

20
00:01:48,060 --> 00:01:48,789
First,

21
00:01:48,789 --> 00:01:51,870
you need to make sure the recording
takes place in a public area.

22
00:01:51,870 --> 00:01:52,400
Also,

23
00:01:52,479 --> 00:01:54,920
you must not use coercion or entrapment.

24
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:38,329
What's going on?

25
00:02:38,400 --> 00:02:39,030
Our big star

26
00:02:39,030 --> 00:02:41,000
is just caught up in a public controversy.

27
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:44,060
How come even the people around you
are abandoning you?

28
00:02:45,960 --> 00:02:47,360
Were you dead yesterday?

29
00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:49,810
What are you doing here now?

30
00:02:52,079 --> 00:02:54,410
I'm here to terminate Mr. Pei's contract.

31
00:02:56,470 --> 00:02:57,920
Then you can get lost.

32
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:01,420
Zhao Xiao,

33
00:03:01,710 --> 00:03:03,080
let me be honest with you.

34
00:03:03,080 --> 00:03:04,480
From the very beginning,

35
00:03:04,560 --> 00:03:06,820
I've genuinely wanted to make you a star.

36
00:03:06,840 --> 00:03:08,280
But I never expected you

37
00:03:08,370 --> 00:03:10,400
to be such a treasure trove of scandals.

38
00:03:10,400 --> 00:03:12,200
There's no end to the dirt on you.

39
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:15,360
Even so,

40
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:17,290
I still want to help you.

41
00:03:19,280 --> 00:03:20,340
Take a look at this.

42
00:03:24,079 --> 00:03:26,400
Are you trying to take advantage
of me while I'm down?

43
00:03:26,400 --> 00:03:28,090
I'm saving you from disaster.

44
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:31,150
But I'm no philanthropist, either.

45
00:03:31,150 --> 00:03:33,750
This contract is
what you'll give me in return.

46
00:03:36,420 --> 00:03:40,870
[Agency Agreement]

47
00:03:40,940 --> 00:03:42,490
[Actor's Agency Agreement]

48
00:03:45,030 --> 00:03:47,060
You want to sign me as your artist?

49
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:48,650
More precisely,

50
00:03:49,760 --> 00:03:52,090
I want complete control over your career.

51
00:03:52,880 --> 00:03:53,730
Why?

52
00:03:54,160 --> 00:03:55,530
I told you a long time ago.

53
00:03:55,530 --> 00:03:57,620
You're the only leading man I want.

54
00:03:58,050 --> 00:03:59,090
But don't worry.

55
00:03:59,160 --> 00:04:00,240
If I'm going to sign you,

56
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:01,440
I have the means

57
00:04:01,560 --> 00:04:03,350
to get you out of this mess.

58
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:05,680
Otherwise, why would I
get involved in all this?

59
00:04:05,680 --> 00:04:06,350
Right?

60
00:04:06,680 --> 00:04:08,850
Why would I sign a disgraced actor

61
00:04:08,880 --> 00:04:10,650
with no commercial value?

62
00:04:12,660 --> 00:04:16,550
Besides, I think you have
no other options right now.

63
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:19,720
How do you plan

64
00:04:19,870 --> 00:04:23,070
to clear my name and put an end
to this public controversy?

65
00:04:25,590 --> 00:04:27,820
[Recording]

66
00:04:30,190 --> 00:04:30,950
Of course,

67
00:04:31,190 --> 00:04:33,860
if you want to record him
in a private setting,

68
00:04:34,070 --> 00:04:36,950
you'll need to invite Zhao Xiao
as a potential business partner

69
00:04:36,950 --> 00:04:38,280
for a film or TV project.

70
00:04:38,370 --> 00:04:40,430
As long as the conversation takes place

71
00:04:40,430 --> 00:04:41,490
under a signed NDA,

72
00:04:41,600 --> 00:04:42,700
your recording

73
00:04:42,920 --> 00:04:45,120
can be admissible as evidence in court.

74
00:04:49,610 --> 00:04:50,740
[Agency Agreement]

75
00:04:51,040 --> 00:04:53,270
I'll tell you once the contract is signed.

76
00:04:53,270 --> 00:04:54,070
Fine.

77
00:04:55,420 --> 00:04:56,720
[Agency Agreement]

78
00:04:58,630 --> 00:05:02,170
[Party A's Representative (Signature): Xu Jing]
[Party B's Representative (Signature): Zhao Xiao]

79
00:05:04,480 --> 00:05:05,270
Tell me.

80
00:05:05,390 --> 00:05:07,390
When the evidence is insufficient,

81
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:10,800
it's only natural for public opinion
to side with the victim.

82
00:05:10,800 --> 00:05:12,280
As for who that victim is,

83
00:05:12,390 --> 00:05:13,680
it could be Wang Yue

84
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:16,790
or it could be you.

85
00:05:20,390 --> 00:05:21,870
What if Wang Yue

86
00:05:21,950 --> 00:05:23,530
were mentally ill?

87
00:05:25,070 --> 00:05:26,650
As your obsessive stalker fan,

88
00:05:26,650 --> 00:05:27,770
she followed you everywhere

89
00:05:27,770 --> 00:05:29,160
and invaded your life,

90
00:05:29,680 --> 00:05:31,830
leaving you severely depressed.

91
00:05:32,950 --> 00:05:34,180
Even so,

92
00:05:34,310 --> 00:05:36,720
being the kind-hearted star you are,

93
00:05:36,870 --> 00:05:39,530
you wanted to help her
get her life back on track.

94
00:05:40,190 --> 00:05:42,390
You even paid for her to see a therapist.

95
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:43,659
But what did she do?

96
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:46,330
Unable to win your love,

97
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:47,860
she turned on you,

98
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:50,600
even threatening suicide

99
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:53,360
to make sure you'd never forget her.

100
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:57,520
What do you think of my story?

101
00:05:58,000 --> 00:05:59,060
That's not a story.

102
00:05:59,510 --> 00:06:00,660
It's the truth.

103
00:06:07,310 --> 00:06:08,160
Zhao Xiao,

104
00:06:08,510 --> 00:06:10,730
we're in this together now.

105
00:06:11,590 --> 00:06:14,520
You asked why
I didn't show up yesterday, didn't you?

106
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:17,720
I was with Wang Yue's mother.

107
00:06:19,360 --> 00:06:20,800
Why were you looking for her?

108
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:22,190
Did she tell you anything?

109
00:06:22,190 --> 00:06:23,560
You've signed an actor's agency agreement.

110
00:06:23,560 --> 00:06:24,690
You should know

111
00:06:26,120 --> 00:06:27,980
that if you hide anything from me,

112
00:06:29,380 --> 00:06:31,870
we'll both pay a heavy price
down the road.

113
00:06:33,840 --> 00:06:35,630
I'm telling you the truth.

114
00:06:36,190 --> 00:06:38,390
I really didn't do anything to Wang Yue.

115
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:39,720
Really?

116
00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:43,159
Then how do you explain
the skin matching test report

117
00:06:43,159 --> 00:06:44,250
for you and Wang Yue?

118
00:06:44,250 --> 00:06:46,130
[First Affiliated Hospital
of Yingcheng Medical University]

119
00:06:46,150 --> 00:06:48,150
[Skin Matching Test Report
for Full-Face Skin Grafting]

120
00:06:55,560 --> 00:06:56,390
[First Affiliated Hospital
of Yingcheng Medical University]

121
00:06:56,409 --> 00:06:57,130
[Skin Matching Test Report
for Full-Face Skin Grafting]

122
00:06:57,150 --> 00:06:57,830
[Full-Face Skin Graft Matching Report]

123
00:07:01,850 --> 00:07:04,070
H-How did you find out about that?

124
00:07:06,120 --> 00:07:07,130
Zhao Xiao,

125
00:07:08,070 --> 00:07:10,330
you should be glad
it was me who found out,

126
00:07:10,630 --> 00:07:12,120
not someone else.

127
00:07:15,270 --> 00:07:16,930
She did it of her own free will.

128
00:07:17,240 --> 00:07:19,340
A fan follows her idol.

129
00:07:19,580 --> 00:07:21,400
When the idol gets into a car accident,

130
00:07:21,400 --> 00:07:23,590
there's nothing the fan can do for him

131
00:07:23,720 --> 00:07:25,380
except sacrifice her own face

132
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:27,840
to save his acting career.

133
00:07:28,240 --> 00:07:30,500
That's perfectly reasonable, isn't it?

134
00:07:33,430 --> 00:07:34,960
Thank you for being honest.

135
00:07:35,390 --> 00:07:36,340
So I take it

136
00:07:36,530 --> 00:07:39,159
your ex-wife, A'lan,
was just like Wang Yue

137
00:07:39,600 --> 00:07:42,270
and willingly donated her skin to you,

138
00:07:43,810 --> 00:07:44,590
right?

139
00:07:45,360 --> 00:07:46,159
That's right.

140
00:07:50,270 --> 00:07:51,600
Oh, Zhao Xiao.

141
00:07:53,070 --> 00:07:54,750
If you won't tell me the truth,

142
00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:57,240
I can't help you.

143
00:08:05,720 --> 00:08:08,080
I've been harassed
by Ms. Wang Yue for a long time,

144
00:08:08,080 --> 00:08:10,280
which has seriously affected
both my physical

145
00:08:08,690 --> 00:08:16,110
[Mr. Zhao Xiao's Press Conference]

146
00:08:10,560 --> 00:08:11,630
and mental health.

147
00:08:12,350 --> 00:08:14,720
I've already shared my medical certificate
documenting my depression

148
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:16,630
during that period with the media.

149
00:08:16,630 --> 00:08:18,040
I never wanted to draw so much

150
00:08:18,040 --> 00:08:19,510
public attention to this matter.

151
00:08:19,510 --> 00:08:20,730
But these baseless accusations

152
00:08:20,730 --> 00:08:22,020
against me

153
00:08:22,390 --> 00:08:23,920
have not only caused me harm

154
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:25,270
but also misled the public.

155
00:08:25,270 --> 00:08:27,750
So I have no choice
but to set the record straight.

156
00:08:27,750 --> 00:08:28,310
I'd like

157
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:31,510
to take this opportunity to urge fans
to be rational in their pursuit of idols.

158
00:08:31,510 --> 00:08:32,240
I don't want to see

159
00:08:32,240 --> 00:08:34,120
anyone else get hurt

160
00:08:34,200 --> 00:08:35,640
or treated unfairly.

161
00:08:43,789 --> 00:08:44,930
Yue,

162
00:08:45,100 --> 00:08:46,360
I'm sorry.

163
00:08:46,960 --> 00:08:49,220
You were falsely accused by that sinner.

164
00:08:49,440 --> 00:08:50,700
Please don't blame me.

165
00:08:50,790 --> 00:08:52,120
I had no other choice.

166
00:08:52,910 --> 00:08:54,370
Just wait a little longer.

167
00:08:54,600 --> 00:08:57,530
Soon, I'll make sure
you get the revenge you deserve.

168
00:08:58,790 --> 00:09:01,480
Actor Zhao Xiao,
who recently weathered a public scandal,

169
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:02,480
has once again earned

170
00:09:02,480 --> 00:09:04,600
widespread acclaim from industry insiders

171
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:08,200
for his outstanding performance
in the short drama Husband's Trap.

172
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:09,480
His agent revealed

173
00:09:09,670 --> 00:09:12,930
that a birthday fan meeting for Zhao Xiao
will be held soon.

174
00:09:12,960 --> 00:09:14,960
In an interview, Zhao Xiao said

175
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:16,720
that although he has yet
to fully recover from what happened,

176
00:09:16,720 --> 00:09:18,320
receiving recognition from the industry

177
00:09:18,320 --> 00:09:21,000
is a great comfort to him.

178
00:09:24,460 --> 00:09:25,350
Long time no see.

179
00:09:25,350 --> 00:09:26,760
-Hello. This way, please.
-Okay.

180
00:09:26,760 --> 00:09:27,620
You made it too.

181
00:09:27,830 --> 00:09:28,830
Long time no see.

182
00:09:29,210 --> 00:09:30,350
Hi, long time no see.

183
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:38,600
What is it?

184
00:09:38,850 --> 00:09:41,720
Even our top agent, Xu, is nervous?

185
00:09:43,250 --> 00:09:44,320
I'm your agent.

186
00:09:44,340 --> 00:09:45,600
Of course I'm nervous.

187
00:09:45,630 --> 00:09:46,650
Relax.

188
00:09:47,510 --> 00:09:49,040
It's just a birthday party.

189
00:09:49,480 --> 00:09:51,280
We've got a long road ahead of us.

190
00:09:51,390 --> 00:09:53,030
I still have you to thank for this.

191
00:09:53,030 --> 00:09:54,690
Think nothing of it, Mr. Zhao.

192
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:01,450
After today's birthday party,

193
00:10:02,630 --> 00:10:04,490
would you be willing to be with me?

194
00:10:15,660 --> 00:10:17,520
Would you be willing to be with me?

195
00:10:19,360 --> 00:10:22,960
All I want is for my face to be restored
to its original condition,

196
00:10:23,710 --> 00:10:26,390
or even made better than ever.
